p><p>(Under current law, reconciliation bills are considered by Congress using expedited legislative procedures that prevent a filibuster and restrict amendments in the Senate.)</p><p>The point of order expires on January 20, 2029.</p>","updateDate":"2025-05-12T15:18:19Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Hands Off Medicaid and SNAP Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-09-08T19:31:27Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-08T19:31:27Z"}
